'''Fossilised dung''' is an item that is received when searching the [[Chest (Tombs of Amascut)|rewards chest]] within the [[Tombs of Amascut]], only if the player has received fewer than 1,500 total reward points.{{CiteNews|url=https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/tombs-of-amascut-drop-mechanics--osmumtens-fang?oldschool=1|title=Tombs of Amascut Drop Mechanics & Osmumten's Fang|newsdate=28 October 2022|quote=You must have at least 1,500 Total points to be eligible for rewards, otherwise you get some Dung.}}

Upon using the dung on the [[nest (nice)|nest]] at the top of the mill in [[Aldarin]], and hopping worlds, a [[nasty token]] can be found in its place.

