==Trivia==
* The interaction with the nest in Aldarin is a reference to “Snuggly the Crow” in ''{{WP|Dark Souls 1}}'' and the “Pickle-Pee, Pump-A-Rum” crow in ''{{Wp|Dark Souls 3}}''. If the player dropped certain items into their nests and reloaded their world, they would find their item replaced with another item, effectively “trading” with the crows.

